{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we subtract from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Reciprocal\" title=\"Reciprocal\">inverse</a> number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, we get the inverse of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. Then the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> equals to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de404a5e26846f66806fcc2449966987d225c904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 0\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } -1\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 3\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"367\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/65039e0f473b155263c751500409b157f40837ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-\\frac1{x-1}=\\frac1{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"37\" />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff3418e764bbd2959564b8bb0d0333c91eb6544b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2=\\frac2{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" /></div>\n<p>Multiplying out and solving, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/8/418f643e71e5caac8852cf24dbeca3b0843257f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1=3\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\